he king is useful, pawn advancement takes priority due to tempo.\n\nReason: Promoting the c3-pawn is the fastest route to gaining a decisive material advantage. Delaying with king moves risks allowing White to reposition and possibly draw. Therefore, advancing the pawn immediately maximizes winning chances.\n\nAnswer: P: c3-c2"}
